DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Stapleton Bluegrass Festival The Stapleton Blue
 grass Festival is not only an outstanding musical event for our area\, but
  it is also crucial to Stapleton School. As our primary annual fundraiser\
 , this event provides much-needed resources to improve the academic and ov
 erall educational experience for our students. Click here for more informa
 tion.   
LOCATION:Stapleton School 35480 Harriott Ave.\, Stapleton\, AL 36578
SUMMARY:Stapleton Bluegrass Festival
END:VEVENT
